Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Caixa-forte novo: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault cifrar: message chave: key.
>> decrypted := vault descifrar: encrypted chave: key.

Saída 
escribir: ['Message:'], salto-de-liña
escribir: message, salto-de-liña
escribir: ['Decrypted:'], salto-de-liña
escribir: decrypted, salto-de-liña.
